      "writtenOn": "2025-04-09T17:14:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is to make this Python module scriptable in the future. The CLI interface code under `if __name__ \u003d\u003d \"__main__\":` is executed only when this module is run standalone (`python pdc_fwup.py ...`), in which case the user needs a CLI. However, if this script is ever imported by another module, you don\u0027t want this CLI interface and the other code would be calling directly into `pdc_fwup.main()`",
